OL,3,GNEWSAHuge mural celebrates
OL,4,AStoke-on-Trent's clubbing heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun on a large mural
OL,7,Fcelebrating Stoke-on-Trent's clubbing
OL,8,Fheritage.
OL,10,FTwo former DJs, Phil Johnson and Bob
OL,11,FLeigh, wanted to pay tribute to the
OL,12,Fcity's venues and its DJs and raised
OL,13,F#11,000 needed for the project.
OL,15,FLocal artist Tom Edwards, who has been
OL,16,Ftasked with creating the work, said it
OL,17,Fhad been a difficult process finalising
OL,18,Fthe design, as there had been so many
OL,19,Fsuggestions of stories and themes from
OL,20,Fthe large community the pair had
OL,21,Fcreated.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
