OL,3,GNEWSAHuge mural celebrates
OL,4,AStoke-on-Trent's clubbing heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe artwork is being painted onto the
OL,7,Fside of a bar on Adventure Place,
OL,8,FHanley, and he is aiming to complete it
OL,9,Fby mid-December.
